    "# 🎨 Complete ComfyUI + GGUF Setup (Once & For All)\n",
    "## Universal Model Library with Cloud-to-Cloud Transfer\n",
    "\n",
    "**This is your ONLY setup cell needed - runs once, saves everything to Google Drive**\n",
    "\n",
    "[![Open In Colab](https://colab.research.google.com/assets/colab-badge.svg)](https://colab.research.google.com/github/aa95-tech/colab-gguf-image-studio/blob/main/notebooks/00_MASTER_SETUP_Complete.ipynb)\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## What This Cell Does (Run Once)\n",
    "\n",
    "✅ Mount Google Drive  \n",
    "✅ Create organized folder structure  \n",
    "✅ Download ALL models + checkpoints + GGUF versions  \n",
    "✅ Cloud-to-cloud transfer (no SIM data usage)  \n",
    "✅ Create symlinks for ComfyUI  \n",
    "✅ Install all dependencies  \n",
    "✅ Save permanently to Drive  \n",
    "\n",
    "**⏱️ Estimated time: 20-40 minutes (one-time only)**"
   ]
  },
